From 65f15767ab0667d7c83d296a1e343b52a0c86556 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Latent <latent@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 11:35:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Dodge & burn: a per-position light map on the print exposure
 (Latent)

Adds spk_params::print_exposure_map (+ _w, _h) and EnlargerParams.printExposureMap.
The map multiplies the enlarger light place by place, after the enlarger diffusion
filter, without moving the mid-grey reference. It is part of the print-density memo
key (content and size). NULL/absent leaves every render byte-identical.
Test: tests/test_dodge_burn.cpp (14 checks).
